        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "When you use the Voracious Blade feat to deal Strength damage with your rhoka sword, you also drain the victim’s blood. The attack deals 1 point of bleed damage in addition to its normal damage, and you gain fast healing 2 for 3 rounds. You can use this ability only once against an individual creature in a 24-hour period."
